From McDonald's to Wendy's, longtime Coke customers have been expanding their beverage offerings to boost their profit margins.

## Summary
Coca-Cola is leveraging secretive innovation labs to automate the production of dirty soda and refreshers. Its customers, including McDonald's and Wendy's, are expanding their beverage offerings to enhance profit margins.

